  [PASS] patch review (no unrelated changes) The original code used 'hour - 1' which contradicts the docstring "hour 0 is the first slot". If hour=0, slots[0-1] = slots[-1], which is the last slot, not the first. The patch correctly changes it to slots[hour], which makes hour 0 map to the first slot as required by the docstring.
